OL,3,GNEWSACare home resident 'covered in
OL,4,Ablood' at breakfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home resident was found with
OL,7,Fblood on their hands and face while
OL,8,Fsitting with seven other people who
OL,9,Fwere eating breakfast, according to an
OL,10,Finspection report.
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) came
OL,13,Facross the scene while inspecting
OL,14,FMelton House care home in Wymondham,
OL,15,FNorfolk.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
