OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACare home resident 'covered in
OL,4,Ablood' at breakfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne resident who displayed "sexualised
OL,7,Fbehaviours" towards others was put in a
OL,8,Froom next to two vulnerable people who
OL,9,Fwere unable to move without staff help,
OL,10,Fthe report found. Another vulnerable
OL,11,Fperson fell into building works at the
OL,12,Fsite, and "excessively full" fly papers
OL,13,Fwere found dangling above people's
OL,14,Fchairs.
OL,16,FThe home said it had made improvements
OL,17,Ffollowing the CQC's visit.
